# Cloudflare Pages Redirects Configuration

# Force HTTPS
http://christagliaferro.com/* https://christagliaferro.com/:splat 301
http://www.christagliaferro.com/* https://www.christagliaferro.com/:splat 301

# Redirect non-www to www (if preferred)
# https://christagliaferro.com/* https://www.christagliaferro.com/:splat 301

# Handle trailing slashes for clean URLs
/services/ /services 301
/portfolio/ /portfolio 301
/i-am/ /i-am 301

# Dynamic service pages (preserve existing routes)
/services/* /services/:splat 200

# 404 fallback - MUST be last rule
/* /404 404 